# valibot 1.0.0 / 1.0.0-beta.14 — ReDoS in EMOJI_REGEX. Transitive via
# @telegram-apps/sdk-react → @telegram-apps/transformers (pinned to
# valibot 1.0.0-beta.14). Direct fix requires npm overrides + retest of
# Telegram Mini App init flow. Not blocking first deploy: input source is
# Telegram bot WebApp init data (signed by Bot API), no untrusted user
# regex input. M16 follow-up — bump @telegram-apps/* to release that
# picks valibot ≥1.2.0.
CVE-2025-66020

# protobuf 6.31.0 — DoS via unbounded recursion. Transitive: grpcio-tools
# 1.73 pins protobuf 6.31. Bot consumes only Telegram Bot API payloads
# (no inbound gRPC from untrusted clients), so unreachable via attacker
# input. M16 follow-up — bump grpcio + grpcio-tools to release that
# allows protobuf 6.33.5+.
CVE-2025-4565
CVE-2026-0994
